// phepng.mmp -- OURS: libpng 1.6.43 + zlib 1.3.1 (libpng / zlib licences) as its own replaceable DLL, app-private under a new name. Code = prebuilt archive (recipes/*.sh + package_x32.sh); exports = phepng.def (gen_defs.py).
TARGET			phepng.dll
TARGETTYPE		dll
UID				0x1000008d 0xE701577C
CAPABILITY		None
VENDORID		0
EPOCALLOWDLLDATA
EPOCHEAPSIZE	0x100000 0x4000000
OS_LAYER_SYSTEMINCLUDE_SYMBIAN
OS_LAYER_LIBC_SYSTEMINCLUDE
SOURCEPATH		.
SOURCE			phepng_dll.c
LIBRARY			euser.lib libc.lib libm.lib libpthread.lib 
SMPSAFE
